paramiko (4.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  To stay inline with current cryptographic best practices and with OpenSSH,
  this release of paramiko (4.0.0) drops support for DSA keys.  You need to
  update any remaining setup still using the deprecated DSA algorithm.

 -- Santiago Ruano Rincón <santiagorr@riseup.net>  Thu, 04 Sep 2025 08:51:53 -0300
